# Wafer Defect Classification - Hackathon Submission

## Overview
This project classifies wafer defects using MobileNetV2.

Phase-1 involved training on 8 defect classes.
Phase-2 evaluated the trained model on a new unseen dataset.

## Model Used
MobileNetV2

## Final Phase-2 Performance
Accuracy  : 42.9%
Precision : 48.1%
Recall    : 49.0%

## Key Highlights
- No retraining in Phase-2 (rule followed strictly)
- Particle class mapped to Others
- Confusion matrix generated
- Clean evaluation pipeline

